## 4. Brevo SMTP Email Setup (`SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASSWORD`)

KnowIT uses **Brevo** (formerly Sendinblue) SMTP for sending account verification and password reset emails.

### External Setup Steps
1. Go to [Brevo Sign-up](https://www.brevo.com/) and log in.
2. Click your account name in the top right -> **SMTP & API Keys**.
3. Select the **SMTP** tab.
4. Note your **SMTP Server** (`smtp-relay.brevo.com`), **Port** (`587`), and **Login email**.
5. Click **Generate a new SMTP key**.
6. Copy the generated master key (starts with `xsmtpsib-`).
7. Set in `.env`:
```ini
SMTP_HOST=smtp-relay.brevo.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_TLS=True
SMTP_USER=your_email@domain.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=xsmtpsib-abcdef12345...
EMAILS_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@knowit.app
EMAILS_FROM_NAME=KnowIT
```

---

## 5. PostgreSQL Database Server (`POSTGRES_SERVER`)

* **When running full stack with Docker Compose (`docker compose up`)**:
  Keep `POSTGRES_SERVER=postgres` (matches container name in `docker-compose.yml`).
* **When running FastAPI backend locally outside Docker (`uv run uvicorn`)**:
  Set `POSTGRES_SERVER=localhost`.
